  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Stem is the target word alone or the word plus means. Opposite-ending distractor plus far bases. Add a lemma picture when the base is concrete.",
    "2": "Five to seven word kid sentence that holds one -ful or -less word. Grade-level opposite and other-word distractors.",
    "3": "A sentence where the opposite ending could fit if the child skips the last letters. Near-miss bases such as help and hope, or care and use."
  },
  "miss_explain": {
